             special.  The aadddduusseerr script will not create and populate a home
             directory by that name.  Otherwise, by default it attempts to
             create a home directory.

     --DD      Do not attempt to create the home directory.

     --EE      Disable the account.  This option will lock the account by
             prepending the string “*LOCKED*” to the password field.  The ac‐
             count may be unlocked by the super-user with the pw(8) command:

                   ppww uunnlloocckk [_n_a_m_e | _u_i_d]

     --ff _f_i_l_e
