             same as the username.  This option makes _l_o_g_i_n___g_r_o_u_p the default.

     --GG _g_r_o_u_p_s
             Space-separated list of additional groups.  This option allows
             the user to specify additional groups to add users to.  The user
             is a member of these groups in addition to their login group.

     --hh      Print a summary of options and exit.

     --kk _d_i_r_e_c_t_o_r_y
             Copy files from _d_i_r_e_c_t_o_r_y into the home directory of new users;
